        {
          "id": "2111884272101691613",
          "text": "What do the mechanics look like here? Do your characters play themselves, like Salty Bet? Or maybe there are cool cinematic options for you in combat, like Persona or Heavy Rain.\n\nI'm not sure! But I'll share more as I figure it out.",
