        },
        {
          "id": "2111884199359897953",
          "text": "One hook I kept coming back to was that I was having as much fun making the game + characters as I was playing it. What if that was the main hook?\n\nI'd distribute the game as open source, you could vibe code your own characters &amp; it would balance it. https://t.co/JcAwTbjimN",
